{"strings": [
  {"text":"WAIT BEHIND THE YELLOW LINE","translation":"ЖДИТЕ ЗА ЖЁЛТОЙ ЛИНИЕЙ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/deck.js"},
  {"text":"COFFEE · 40 cr","translation":"КОФЕ · 40 кр","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/drone.js"},
  {"text":"NO QUEUE*","translation":"БЕЗ ОЧЕРЕДИ*","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/drone.js"},
  {"text":"hot","translation":"горячий","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/drone.js"},
  {"text":"*except for coffee","translation":"*кроме кофе","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/drone.js"},
  {"text":"OPEN","translation":"ОТКРЫТО","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/inspector.js"},
  {"text":"BREAK","translation":"ПЕРЕРЫВ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/inspector.js"},
  {"text":"WINDOW 3","translation":"ОКНО №3","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/inspector.js"},
  {"text":"DEFINITELY NOT","translation":"ТОЧНО НЕ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/ship.js"},
  {"text":"CONTRABAND","translation":"КОНТРАБАНДА","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/ship.js"},
  {"text":"MODESTY","translation":"СКРОМНОСТЬ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/ship.js"},
  {"text":"JU-77/3 · CARGO","translation":"ЮП-77/3 · ГРУЗОВОЙ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/ship.js"},
  {"text":"QUEUE HERE","translation":"ОЧЕРЕДЬ ТУТ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/stanchions.js"},
  {"text":"BELT-EAST","translation":"ПОЯС-ВОСТОК","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/station.js"},
  {"text":"NOW SERVING","translation":"ОБСЛУЖИВАЕТСЯ","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/tablo.js"},
  {"text":"YOUR NUMBER","translation":"ВАШ НОМЕР","where":"scenes/okno-3/elements/tablo.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3","translation":"Окно №3","where":"scenes/okno-3/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"An electronic queue at the asteroid belt. Nobody here is in a hurry. Except you.","translation":"Электронная очередь у пояса астероидов. Здесь никто никуда не спешит — кроме вас.","where":"scenes/okno-3/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Belt-East checkpoint. Forty minutes' flight to Jupiter. Eleven days to the window.","translation":"Пункт пропуска «Пояс-Восток». До Юпитера сорок минут лёта. До окна — одиннадцать суток.","where":"scenes/okno-3/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"They invented the warp drive. They couldn't get rid of form F-12 in triplicate.","translation":"Варп-двигатель изобрели. Отменить бланк Ф-12 в трёх экземплярах — не смогли.","where":"scenes/okno-3/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Gena filled it in twice. The third copy floated away.","translation":"Гена заполнил его дважды. Третий экземпляр улетел.","where":"scenes/okno-3/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"Window 3 is open again.","translation":"Окно №3 снова открыто.","where":"scenes/okno-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3 has closed for a technical break.","translation":"Окно №3 закрылось на технический перерыв.","where":"scenes/okno-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"A golden yacht with a flashing light went straight to the window, no queue. Your number has been recalculated.","translation":"Золотая яхта с мигалкой прошла к окну без очереди. Ваш номер пересчитан.","where":"scenes/okno-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"≈ {days} days","translation":"≈ {days} сут.","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"break","translation":"перерыв","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Electronic queue · window 3","translation":"Электронная очередь · окно №3","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Now","translation":"Сейчас","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Your number","translation":"Ваш номер","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Waiting","translation":"Ожидание","where":"scenes/okno-3/widgets/board.html"}
]}
